A***************************************************************
     A* LFTEAMLST - Join Logical File over PPQ_TEAM + SEC_USER +
     A* MDDPRTMNT. DDS replacement for SQL view V_PPQ_TEAM_LIST.
     A* JDFTVAL on the department join approximates the original
     A* LEFT JOIN MD_DEPARTMENT (unmatched dept still returns the row).
     A***************************************************************
     A                                      JDFTVAL
     A          R TEAMLSTR                  JFILE(PPQ_TEAM SEC_USER MDDPRTMNT)
     A          J                           JOIN(1 2)
     A                                      JFLD(USER_ID USER_ID)
     A          J                           JOIN(1 3)
     A                                      JFLD(DEPT_CD DEPT_CD)
     A            PROTOCOLID
     A                                      ALIAS(PROTOCOL_ID)
     A            MEMBER_SEQ
     A            USER_ID                   JREF(1)
     A            FULL_NAME
     A            DSGNTN
     A                                      ALIAS(DESIGNATION)
     A            DEPT_CD                   JREF(1)
     A            DEPT_NAME
     A            RSPNSBLTY
     A                                      ALIAS(RESPONSIBILITY)
     A            APPRSTATUS
     A                                      ALIAS(APPR_STATUS)
